OL,3,GNEWSAFire wardens patrol flats after
OL,4,Afailed inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 residents have been left
OL,7,Fliving in uncertainty after a group of
OL,8,Fflats failed a fire safety inspection,
OL,9,Frequiring wardens to be on patrol 24/7.
OL,11,FPeople living in Foulgers Opening off
OL,12,FBer Street, Norwich, say they have been
OL,13,Fgiven little information from Orbit
OL,14,FGroup, the housing association that
OL,15,Fmanages the properties.
OL,17,FThe firm said the "waking watch"
OL,18,Fwardens had been employed as a
OL,19,F"precautionary measure" until fire
OL,20,Fsafety in the dozens of flats is
OL,21,Fimproved.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
